infra/aws/backoffice-ids.env

# Incident forensics captured from a live deployment. Untracked BY INSTRUCTION (S8-16: the
# product owner fenced the device-testing investigation out of the commit), and gitignored so
# that instruction survives a session-end `git add -A` rather than depending on someone
# remembering it. Same reason infra/aws/*-ids.env is fenced: no secrets, but AWS account ids,
# subnet/ENI ids and private IPs are account-specific detail with no business in the repository.
docs/incidents/
~$*.docx
